{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"Start with the Maclaurin series for $\\sin (x)$.\n\n$\\displaystyle\\sin (x)=x-\\frac{{{x}^{3}}}{3!}+\\frac{{{x}^{5}}}{5!}-...+{{\\left( -1 \\right)}^{n}}\\frac{{{x}^{2n+1}}}{\\left( 2n+1 \\right)!}+...$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Substitute $2x$ for $x$.\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\displaystyle\\sin (2x)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2x-\\dfrac{(2x)^3}{3!}+\\dfrac{(2x)^5}{5!}-...+{{\\left( -1 \\right)}^{n}}\\dfrac{{{(2x)}^{2n+1}}}{\\left( 2n+1 \\right)!}+...\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2x-\\dfrac{8x^3}{3!}+\\dfrac{32x^5}{5!}-...+{{\\left( -1 \\right)}^{n}}\\dfrac{{{(2x)}^{2n+1}}}{\\left( 2n+1 \\right)!}+...\n\\end{align}$\n","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The first three non-zero terms are\n\n$2x-\\dfrac{8x^3}{3!}+\\dfrac{32x^5}{5!}$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**What are the first three non-zero terms of the Maclaurin series for the function $f(x)=\\sin(2x)$?**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$\\displaystyle 2x-\\frac{2x^3}{3!}+\\frac{2x^5}{5!}$","correct":false},{"content":"$\\displaystyle x-\\frac{8x^3}{3!}+\\frac{32x^5}{5!}$","correct":false},{"content":"$\\displaystyle x+\\frac{8x^3}{3!}-\\frac{32x^5}{5!}$","correct":false},{"content":"$\\displaystyle 2x-\\frac{8x^3}{3!}+\\frac{32x^5}{5!}$","correct":true}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"onePerLine":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
